OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACalls to mark historic bridge's
OL,4,A250th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bridge, which crosses the River
OL,7,FThames between Maidenhead and Taplow,
OL,8,Fwas designed by Sir Robert Taylor and
OL,9,Fcompleted in 1777. It is Grade I listed
OL,10,Fand features Portland stone arches,
OL,11,Fwith the rest of the structure built of
OL,12,Fbrick.
OL,14,FRoyal Borough of Windsor and Maidenhead
OL,15,Fcouncillor Clive Baskerville said
OL,16,Fcelebrations were planned and something
OL,17,Fwas "in the making".
